# Epson V850 replay fixture: 'v800_bringup prescan' (origin bed prescan, 5.9 x 9.7 in at 200 dpi high speed -> 1176 x 1940 RGB16; cold start: 4 busy FS G polls, then a silent ~5 s FS G read).
# Captured 2026-10-09 from an Epson Perfection V850 (04b8:0151) on Linux during live bring-up, recorded by crates/epson/examples/v800_bringup.rs (RecordingTransport, payloads cut at 256 bytes) in a fresh process, so carriage calibration started Unknown.
